Wild Card is a 2015 American action thriller film directed by Simon West and starring Jason Statham,
Michael Angarano, Milo Ventimiglia, Dominik Garcia-Lorido, Anne Heche, and Sofia Vergara.

11
01:03:15,000 --> 01:03:21,000
Based on the 1985 novel Heat by William Goldman, it is a remake of
the 1986 adaptation that starred Burt Reynolds.

12
01:09:00,000 --> 01:09:06,000
The film was released in the United States on January 30, 2015 in
a limited release and through video on demand.

13
01:14:45,000 --> 01:14:51,000
Wild Card received negative reviews and was a box-office bomb, making
only $6.7 million worldwide against a $30 million budget.

